Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}For a small teaching graph, recomputing affinities from original edges is a clear implementation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}对于教学小图，从原始边重新计算亲和度是一种清晰的实现方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:12.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}After each merge, update membership and sizes, then rebuild the candidate list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:12.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}每次合并后，更新成员关系和大小，再重建候选列表。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:18.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}One blocked candidate does not justify stopping; another legal pair may still exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:18.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}一个候选被容量阻止，并不意味着可以停止；可能还有其他合法簇对。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:23.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Stop at K, or when every positive-affinity candidate is illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:23.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}达到 K 时停止，或者在所有正亲和度候选都不合法时停止。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our reference rejects invalid sizes and never forces a zero-affinity merge just to reach K.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}参考实现拒绝无效大小，也不会为了凑够 K 而强行合并零亲和度簇对。
